        "every_major_discovery",
        "before_each_work_phase",
        "after_validation",
        "final_summary"
      ],
      "notes": "适合希望强交互、希望助手边做边说的场景。"
    },
    "steady_secretary": {
      "displayName": "稳重秘书模式",
      "tone": "稳重、清晰、职业化",
